  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AZN: Women&#x2019;s Political Academy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to deliver trainings to 20 women aged 20-40 residing in Barda, Aghdam, Tartar, Yevlakh, Agjabedi, and neighbouring regions so that they can participate in the political arena; to raise awareness on the importance of women&#x2019;s political engagement through motivational and educational activities; and to raise the profile of the Chevening programme by bringing the alumni together. This project will also contribute to the equal participation of people which is one of the core priorities of civil society organizations.</narrative>
  </description>
